 r visa-free transit — keep the onward ticket handy). 3U-3963 departs 09:
 40 Oct 26\, lands KIX Terminal 1 at 14:35 — two hours before Yulia. Bagg
 age: 1 checked + 8 kg cabin. Refs in the Aviakassa receipt.
