SUMMARY:🏯 Osaka Castle
LOCATION:Osaka Castle
DESCRIPTION:Metro to Tanimachi 4-chōme\, walk up through the park. Admissi
 on ¥1\,200 — buy the timed e-ticket online. Kuromon market breakfast be
 fore · kushikatsu lunch after · Umeda Sky at 16:30 for sunset · evening
  = the vote (Kaiyukan aquarium or Namba izakaya).
END:VEVENT
