DTEND;TZID=Asia/Tokyo:20261028T103000
SUMMARY:🎫 Activate JR Passes → move to Kyoto
LOCATION:Osaka Station JR ticket office
DESCRIPTION:Exchange the vouchers + activate all three 7-day JR Passes (val
 id through Nov 3). Reserve the Oct 31 Hiroshima seats\, Nov 2 Odawara and 
 Nov 3 Tokyo legs at the same time — free with the pass. Then the JR Kyot
 o line ~30 min. Afternoon: Kinkaku-ji → Ryōan-ji → Sanjūsangen-dō 
 · Gion at dusk.
