SUMMARY:🎋 Arashiyama — bamboo\, Tenryū-ji\, monkeys
LOCATION:Arashiyama\, Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:JR Sagano line from Kyoto Station ~20 min (covered). Leave by 8
 :00 — at the bamboo grove by 8:30 it is still yours. Tenryū-ji ¥500 ·
  yuba lunch by Togetsu-kyō · Iwatayama Monkey Park ¥800 (entry to 16:00
 ).
END:VEVENT
