SUMMARY:🦌 Nara day trip
LOCATION:Nara Park
DESCRIPTION:JR Miyakoji Rapid ~45 min (covered). Deer crackers ~¥200 — b
 ow first\, they bow back. Tōdai-ji Great Buddha ¥800 · kakinoha-zushi l
 unch · Harushika sake tasting ¥500 · back to Kyoto by evening.
END:VEVENT
