LOCATION:Kyoto Station
DESCRIPTION:Leave the hotel 7:30. ~08:03 Hikari/Sakura (~2h\, covered — N
 ozomi is not). Arrive ~10:10. Morning: Peace Memorial Park\, A-Bomb Dome\,
  Peace Memorial Museum ¥200 (web ticket bought ahead). Lunch: Hiroshima o
 konomiyaki at Nagata-ya.
