SUMMARY:⛩️ Miyajima — Itsukushima Shrine
LOCATION:Miyajima\, Hiroshima
DESCRIPTION:JR train to Miyajimaguchi (~30 min) + JR ferry — both covered
  by the pass (+¥100 island tax). Itsukushima Shrine ¥300 · the great to
 rii in the sea · momiji manju warm off the griddle. 18:03 shinkansen back
  · Kyoto ~20:30.
END:VEVENT
