SUMMARY:⛩️ Fushimi Inari — the ten thousand torii
LOCATION:Fushimi Inari Taisha\, Kyoto
DESCRIPTION:JR Nara line 2 stops (covered)\, free\, open always. Early beat
 s the crowds. Afternoon is the free slot — Ginkaku-ji\, Nishiki Market o
 r Higashiyama\, whatever won the vote. Tonight: pack an overnight bag for 
 Hakone.
END:VEVENT
