SUMMARY:🚄 Kyoto → Hakone (forward the big bags!)
LOCATION:Kyoto Station
DESCRIPTION:At checkout ~8:30: send the big suitcases to the Tokyo hotel by
  takkyubin (front desk arranges it\, ~¥2\,000–2\,500/bag\, arrives next
  day) — take overnight bags only. Shinkansen to Odawara ~2h (covered)\, 
 then Hakone Freepass ~¥5\,000 (2 days): Tozan line · Lake Ashi pirate sh
 ip · ropeway over Ōwakudani (black eggs).
